' gantt: NaturalGanttTask
@startgantt
[A] lasts 5 days
[H] lasts 1 day and displays on same row as [A]
[I] lasts 2 days and is 40% complete
[J] lasts 1 day and is deleted
[L] lasts 2 days and links to [[http://x.org]]
[L] is displayed as Label text
then [N] lasts 3 days
it is colored in red
[P] <<milestone>> lasts 1 day
@endgantt
